@startuml
[*] --> InitialState
 initialState: Initial State

 InitialState --> CreateWorkspace: Create New Workspace
 CreateWorkspace --> AddingWorkspace: Add workspace details
 AddingWorkspace --> WorkspaceAdded: Workspace created
 WorkspaceAdded --> [*]

 InitialState --> ViewWorkspaces: View Workspaces
 ViewWorkspaces --> ViewingWorkspaces: Display workspaces
 ViewingWorkspaces --> SwitchWorkspace: Switch to another workspace
 SwitchWorkspace --> SwitchingWorkspace: Switching to selected workspace
 SwitchingWorkspace --> [*]

 ViewingWorkspaces --> ManageWorkspace: Manage workspace
 ManageWorkspace --> ManagingWorkspace: Edit/Delete workspace
 ManagingWorkspace --> [*]

 [*] --> FinalState
 FinalState: Exit System
 [*] --> [*]
@enduml
